'The workflow connects discovery with follow-up. After authentication, a student chooses an opportunity or support service. The server checks the request and stores it. A coordinator can then review the record and update its status. Returning to the student workspace shows the latest persisted result.',
'A typical transaction begins when a signed-in user selects an action. The API checks the session, role and input before changing data. The result then returns to the interface. For applications, this sequence continues with coordinator review and a student-visible decision, forming a traceable cycle.'
